According to a report by Intel Market Research, Global Residential Iron Steel Door market was valued at USD 12.5 billion in 2025. The market is projected to grow from USD 13 billion in 2026 to USD 18 billion by 2034, delivering a CAGR of 4.1% during the forecast period.
Residential iron steel doors are engineered entry solutions that blend durability, security, and aesthetic appeal for homes. These doors are built from cold rolled or galvanized steel frames with reinforced panels, providing impact resistance, corrosion protection through powder coating or galvanization, and customizable designs that span classic panel styles to contemporary minimalistic finishes.
